   POPUP FIX — Graffik Gillette (v2)
   Desktop: keep original popup sizes (full-cell overlay is by design
   — the user WANTS relief/OT popups to cover adjacent cells).
   Mobile: enlarge OT detail popup so text fits properly.
   ============================================================ */

/* ── 1. Z-index hierarchy (desktop) ── */
.day-cell .ot-marker {
